      "decision_index": 372,
    },
    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "With Faith's Fetters on the stack and 3 untapped Plains available, GPT54 Sport could have activated Emiel the Blessed to blink Rambunctious Mutt, destroying one of the opponent's artifacts or enchantments (Magnifying Glass, Planar Atlas, or Clue Token) while also gaining 1 life from Distinguished Conjurer's trigger. In a close game at 10 vs 11 life, destroying a mana-producing artifact from an Urza-lands opponent is highly impactful.",
      "action_taken": "Passed priority without activating Emiel the Blessed, wasting 3 available mana and missing a free ETB trigger.",
      "better_line": "Activate Emiel the Blessed targeting Rambunctious Mutt (3 mana). When Mutt re-enters, destroy an opponent's artifact (likely Magnifying Glass or Planar Atlas to deny mana), gain 1 life from Distinguished Conjurer, then let Faith's Fetters resolve on Shambling Suit.",
